  displayName: Werewolf
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3f3f7fdd6cae0a44e802ee32829869d7, type: 3}
  description: "The werewolf is a medium-sized undead beast, shaped like a wolf-man
    - taller than a wolf, broader than a man - with a visible tail that whips as
    it runs. It moves fast, closing distance in a blur of claws and teeth. It doesn\u2019t
    speak; it communicates with raw animalistic sounds - growls, snarls, and hunting
    howls that sound like hunger given a voice."
